- Continue modularization more aggressively but only for bounded tab-owned behavior. This release moves Debug Unlock All Items/theme-level control handlers into `codes/tabs/debug.js` and Store category state/switching into `codes/tabs/store.js`.
- Keep authentication, hydrated account state, Sandbox isolation checks, shared state mutation authority, save/cloud-sync paths, and core render coordination in `index.html`. Modules must use the existing shared functions and must not write directly to localStorage or Supabase.
- Module initialization must be idempotent; never register duplicate event listeners when a tab is selected or initialized more than once.
- Update Debug report versions, service-worker cache namespace, and top changelog entry together. Run JavaScript syntax checks, assert the removed reset control/handler is absent, assert moved handlers exist only in their module, check module paths and ZIP integrity. Mark live browser/Supabase checks INCONCLUSIVE unless actually performed.

