- Build from v2.1.2. Preserve the existing tab code separation; this update does not require further module extraction.
- Admin “Reset all themes to Store” is available with Sandbox active or inactive, with explicit confirmation. In live mode, save through the normal live save path; in Sandbox, affect only the temporary Sandbox state. Preserve Dungeon as owned/equipped fallback and do not alter artifacts, pets, currency, XP, quests, or unrelated progress.
