- Update Debug report versions, service-worker cache namespace, and the top changelog entry together. Check JavaScript syntax, theme-only reset filtering, fallback equipment, theme level/perk values, non-theme invariance, and ZIP integrity. Mark live browser/Supabase checks INCONCLUSIVE unless actually performed.

